  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Housing Improvement Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Mejoramiento de Vivienda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir a la mejora de la calidad de la vivienda de los hogares vulnerables en Asuncin y el Departamento Central de Paraguay (ADC). Los objetivos especficos son: (i) ampliar el acceso a soluciones de mejoramiento de vivienda para los hogares vulnerables en el ADC; y (ii) fortalecer las capacidades del Ministerio de Urbanismo, Vivienda y Hbitat (MUVH) para implementar la Poltica Nacional de Urbanismo, Vivienda y Hbitat (PNUVH)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to contribute to improving the quality of housing for vulnerable households in Asuncin and the Central Department of Paraguay (ADC). The specific objectives are: (i) by expanding access to housing improvement solutions for vulnerable households, and (ii) by strengthening the capacities of the Ministry of Urban Planning, Housing and Habitat (MUVH) to implement the National Urban Planning, Housing and Habitat Policy (PNUVH)</narrative>
  </description>
